{"title":"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/6/cd6b86ee6510acface52f9de9abfea942179084e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{y}=\\frac{3}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"50\" height=\"41\" />, then the incorrect expression in the following is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/e/0ee2166aeebe0767ca9092878eef68b1bdf80716.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) \\ }\\frac{x+y}{y}=\\frac{7}{4}  \\qquad \\textbf{(B) \\ }\\frac{y}{y-x}=\\frac{4}{1} \\qquad \\textbf{(C) \\ }\\frac{x+2y}{x}=\\frac{11}{3} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"458\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/4/fd4bfff00c2af9176d778d353f5d625677ffe0ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D) \\ }\\frac{x}{2y}=\\frac{3}{8} \\qquad \\textbf{(E) \\ }\\frac{x-y}{y}=\\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -16px\" width=\"257\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let's consider each answer choice.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/9/6d94ea9869ad631db6d123a7e224daca3c1411aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{A.} \\quad \\frac{x+y}{y}=\\frac{x}{y}+\\frac{y}{y}=\\frac{3}{4}+1=\\boxed{\\frac{7}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"284\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f999bd04cd8ea3f7b7291fc085cdada5a24fbab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{B.} \\quad \\frac{y-x}{y}=\\frac{y}{y}-\\frac{x}{y}=1-\\frac{3}{4}=\\frac{1}{4}\\implies \\left(\\frac{y-x}{y}\\right)^{-1}=\\frac{y}{y-x}=\\boxed{\\frac{4}{1}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"533\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/5/13542b508141bf12b01b74ed85ede10933291027.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C.} \\quad \\frac{x+2y}{x}=\\frac{x}{x}+\\frac{2y}{x}=1+2\\cdot \\frac{4}{3}=\\boxed{\\frac{11}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"334\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/f/1cfd1e2bff2d59493bf6831ff97a1183eb974855.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{D.} \\quad \\frac{x}{2y}=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\frac{3}{4}=\\boxed{\\frac{3}{8}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"183\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/b/abbc5fa472463613659472fe97bdd65424b1be54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{E.} \\quad \\frac{x-y}{y}=\\frac{x}{y}-\\frac{y}{y}=\\frac{3}{4}-1=\\boxed{-\\frac{1}{4}}\\neq \\frac{1}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"338\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>Hence, the incorrect expression is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/0/c90870108e1ffc40eb196f847fd94069d5476e28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{x-y}{y}=\\frac{1}{4}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"128\" height=\"51\" />.\n</p><p>Note: If you're bad at fraction manipulation, you can plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/2/b022dc8ef6d33931fc1ae3d27df3ea0a81b52936.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/b/45bc0006df273cb384b6c864236b3c1bf292e898.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"17\" /> and find which expression is false.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME\" title=\"1952 AHSME\">1952 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1952 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1952\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1952_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1952 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\"